Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: func_def
    2        | var_decl_stmt_list func_def
    3        | func_decl func_def
    4        | var_decl_stmt_list func_decl func_def
    5        | func_decl var_decl_stmt_list func_def
    6        | var_decl_stmt_list func_decl var_decl_stmt_list func_def

    7 func_decl: func_header LEFT_ROUND_BRACKET formal_param_list RIGHT_ROUND_BRACKET SEMICOLON
    8          | func_header LEFT_ROUND_BRACKET RIGHT_ROUND_BRACKET SEMICOLON

    9 func_header: named_type NAME

   10 func_def: func_header LEFT_ROUND_BRACKET formal_param_list RIGHT_ROUND_BRACKET LEFT_CURLY_BRACKET optional_local_var_decl_stmt_list statement_list RIGHT_CURLY_BRACKET
   11         | func_header LEFT_ROUND_BRACKET RIGHT_ROUND_BRACKET LEFT_CURLY_BRACKET optional_local_var_decl_stmt_list statement_list RIGHT_CURLY_BRACKET

   12 formal_param_list: formal_param_list COMMA formal_param
   13                  | formal_param

   14 formal_param: param_type NAME

   15 param_type: INTEGER
   16           | FLOAT
   17           | BOOL
   18           | STRING

   19 statement_list: statement_list statement
   20               | ε

   21 statement: assignment_statement
   22          | print_statement
   23          | read_statement

   24 optional_local_var_decl_stmt_list: ε
   25                                  | var_decl_stmt_list

   26 var_decl_stmt_list: var_decl_stmt
   27                   | var_decl_stmt_list var_decl_stmt

   28 var_decl_stmt: named_type var_decl_item_list SEMICOLON

   29 var_decl_item_list: var_decl_item_list COMMA var_decl_item
   30                   | var_decl_item

   31 var_decl_item: NAME

   32 named_type: INTEGER
   33           | FLOAT
   34           | VOID
   35           | STRING
   36           | BOOL

   37 assignment_statement: variable_as_operand ASSIGN_OP expression SEMICOLON

   38 print_statement: WRITE expression SEMICOLON

   39 read_statement: READ variable_name SEMICOLON

   40 expression: expression PLUS expression
   41           | expression MINUS expression
   42           | expression MULT expression
   43           | expression DIV expression
   44           | MINUS expression
   45           | LEFT_ROUND_BRACKET expression RIGHT_ROUND_BRACKET
   46           | variable_as_operand
   47           | constant_as_operand

   48 variable_as_operand: variable_name

   49 variable_name: NAME

   50 constant_as_operand: INT_NUM
   51                    | FLOAT_NUM
   52                    | STR_CONST


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    error (256)
    VOID (258) 34
    INTEGER (259) 15 32
    STRING (260) 18 35
    FLOAT (261) 16 33
    BOOL (262) 17 36
    NAME <sval> (263) 9 14 31 49
    READ (264) 39
    WRITE (265) 38
    INT_NUM <ival> (266) 50
    FLOAT_NUM <fval> (267) 51
    STR_CONST <sval> (268) 52
    PLUS (269) 40
    MINUS (270) 41 44
    MULT (271) 42
    DIV (272) 43
    ASSIGN_OP (273) 37
    SEMICOLON (274) 7 8 28 37 38 39
    COMMA (275) 12 29
    LEFT_ROUND_BRACKET (276) 7 8 10 11 45
    RIGHT_ROUND_BRACKET (277) 7 8 10 11 45
    LEFT_CURLY_BRACKET (278) 10 11
    RIGHT_CURLY_BRACKET (279) 10 11
    UMINUS (280)


